{"unit_id":"Kaiji-Z__dsh-plugin-stardeck#feature-1","repo":"Kaiji-Z/dsh-plugin-stardeck","commit":"86b26e7157af6b2d344c9ed440dcfe6c2c890ed6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-stardeck 的功能「命令转任务」：通过 /war 激活舰桥并提交战略意图，再由大副起草任务说明和验收标准；经发布后任务进入战略任务栏并可唤醒执行队伍。用户可以继续用 /peace 让舰桥休眠。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.ts:54","src/commands.ts:80","src/commands.ts:90","src/tools.ts:435"]}
